0,Mitla Zapotec - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mitla_Zapotec,"Mitla Zapotec, or Didxsaj,[2] is an Oto-Manguean language of Oaxaca, Mexico. Guelavia Zapotec is reported to be 75% intelligible, but the reverse is apparently not the case.","Zapotec, Mitla",Otomanguean
1,Oto-Manguean languages - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oto-Manguean_languages,"The highest number of speakers of Oto-Manguean languages today is in the Mexican state of Oaxaca, where the two largest branches, the Zapotecan and the Mixtecan languages, are spoken by almost 1.5 million people combined.","Zapotec, Mitla",Otomanguean
